CREATED:20170503T225835Z
UID:28551D41-2BA5-4AA2-BEE3-056E4B37476C
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20170801T200000
SUMMARY:notes about your life
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20170801T070000
DTSTAMP:20170721T032241Z
LOCATION:go to bed and get up at mature person times. Do groceries and su
 ch -- check prices at Walmart\, Winco\, Co-op\, etc and decide where to 
 get what. Work out together and get crazy hot. Start forming good habits
  now so they're set by the time classes start. The full day detailed sch
 edule was totally crazy\, but that might be how you're gonna have to app
 roach your life to tackle this semester and graduate on time with a doub
 le major. Spring can be a chill semester if you bust your ass this fall.
  Don't lose yourself! Remember to have fun and enjoy life and party a li
 ttle (or a lottle) bit. Always love Gilberto <3. You're a sophomore! Go 
 chase the life you want!
SEQUENCE:0
END:VEVENT
